#### RESERVATIONS

### List all reservations
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/reservations

### Find 1 reservation
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/reservations/3

### Create a new reservation
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "startDate": "2026-08-04",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06",
    "userId": 4,
    "localId": 2
}

### Update a reservation
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/reservations/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "startDate": "2026-05-01",
    "endDate": "2026-06-01"
}

### Delete a reservation
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/reservations/14

#### LOCALS
### Create a new local
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/locals
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Studio Ghibli",
    "address": "5545 Rue Saint-Michel, Montreal",
    "description": "Beautiful house in downtown Montreal",
    "pricePerDay": 125,
    "lat": 46.6,
    "lng": -76.7
}

### List all locals
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/locals

### Find a local by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/locals/1

### Update a local
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/locals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pricePerDay": 99.99,
    "description": "Beautiful studio with wifi and AC"
}

### Delete a local
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/locals/4

